# Surveil 1 may put the top card into the graveyard: the Island goes there. The Backstreet entered tapped on turn 1 and is
# untapped on turn 3, where its intrinsic basic land types (Plains Swamp) let it tap for {B} or {W} (here black).

[Bot1 Deck]
Shadowy Backstreet
Mountain x6
Island
Mountain x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Shadowy Backstreet.Play
Bot1.Arrange( | Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Shadowy Backstreet.Activate(Ability: {B})

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Island
Bot1.Mana = {B}
